        "### STAINING:",
        "Staining is one such contrasting process where in chemicals (stains) are used to impart their color to the cells structures with which they come in contact.",
        "### Types of staining",
        "There are following types of staining:",
        "➢Simple staining",
        "➢Differential staining",
