        "### Simple Staining:",
        "It is the most valuable stain for staining bacteria.",
        "It is excellent for the genus Corynebacterium",
        "In sporing bacilli stained with this stain the spore appear as unstained bodies within blue cells. **Procedure: ** 1- Stain for 1 min. 2- Rinse with water. 3- Dry it",
        "### Simple Staining of Yeast:",
